        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Astronaut_Harrison_Schmitt_inside_the_lunar_module_on_lunar_surface_after_EVA_(as17-134-20530).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 22.7,
